* ============================================================================
* L78L05 - 5 V 100 mA linear regulator, behavioural model (2026-09-28)
* The board uses ST L78L05ACUTR (U1 = analog_5V, U17 = digital 5 V).  Not an ST model: this is the same behaviour
* as LM78L05.lib in this folder (1.7 V dropout, 0.5 ohm output, 3 mA quiescent).  ST's data sheet was not read
* (PDF), so these figures are unverified for the ST part.
* NOT MODELLED: current limit, thermal shutdown, PSRR vs frequency, start-up.
* ============================================================================
.SUBCKT L78L05 IN OUT GND
BR n1 GND V=min(V(IN)-V(GND)-1.7, 5.0)
RO n1 OUT 0.5
IQ IN GND 3m
.ENDS L78L05
